The update-check store mirrors the exe-digest store's per-user path precedence (explicit DB override, then the GIT_SPAN_CACHE_HOME base, then the $HOME/.cache/git-span default) and its fail-closed open bootstrap (busy timeout before WAL before schema), the chain the package README documents for exe-digest; the update-check store additionally falls back to %USERPROFILE% on Windows, and any change to the shared chain must land identically on all three surfaces.
